sequenceDiagram
    title Provisioning failure and rollback
    participant Application
    participant DataOwner
    participant IdentityProvider
    participant IdentityAdmin

    %% EDGE: WF-06
    DataOwner->>Application: Approve data access
    Application->>IdentityProvider: Start provisioning

    %% EDGE: WF-08
    IdentityProvider-->>Application: Failed to grant access

    %% EDGE: WF-09
    IdentityProvider->>Application: Rollback request for partial access grant
    Application->>IdentityAdmin: Assign partial access removal

    %% EDGE: WF-10
    IdentityAdmin->>IdentityProvider: Remove partial access and close rollback
    IdentityAdmin-->>Application: Partial access removed and request rolled back
